  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></munderover><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is",
